{"id":"u-9669b3c2-5139-4793-b754-eb63242d8252","src":"community","title":"HORRIFYING HYBRID: Aesthetic + Athletic Domination","author":"Bazilian C.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/TUGZHZ-horrifying-hybrid-aesthetic-athletic-domination","desc":"This program is built for teenage athletes who want to become absolute monsters—visually and physically. It’s engineered to develop a shredded, wide, dense physique that turns heads at school and the mall while creating terrifying power on the lacrosse field. By combining aesthetic hypertrophy with explosive strength, you’ll train like someone who actually moves people, not just poses.\n\nYou’ll train 5 days a week, with 3 upper body sessions to carve out that David Laid chest and wide V-taper, and 2 intense leg sessions to build tree-trunk legs with speed and power. Posterior chain work keeps you fast, aesthetic leg work makes you look deadly. Built-in core, grip, and posture work ensures you’re not just strong—you’re unbreakable.\n\nExpect to be the strongest, leanest, and most feared 15-year-old in the room. This is the blueprint to grow taller, gain muscle fast, and dominate every field you walk on.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Strength","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":15,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-22T11:02:27.487Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push: Chest, Shoulders, Tricep","Pull: Back, Biceps, Grip","Legs: Power + Athleticism","Upper Volume: Chest, Arm, Post","Leg: Aesthetic Hypertrophy"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8.5,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":20,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Wall Angels","set